@baseUrl = http://localhost:5090

### List the books
GET {{baseUrl}}/books

### Borrow a book
POST {{baseUrl}}/loans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "memberId": "M-100",
  "isbn": "9780134685991"
}

### A member who is not in the directory
POST {{baseUrl}}/loans
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "memberId": "M-999",
  "isbn": "9780134685991"
}

### Look up a member (Morgan owes 12.50 in fines)
GET {{baseUrl}}/members/M-300
